Godmode 0.14.0
https://github.com/lofimichael/godmode-cli

  Godmode keeps your business profile and API keys in one local place
  for your coding agents. Agents read godmode help and use keys through
  godmode run.

Install

  gh api -H 'Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json' \
    repos/lofimichael/godmode-cli/contents/install.sh | sh -s -- --path

Picard

  godmode picard link     print the original YTMND URL
  godmode picard open     open it in a browser
  godmode picard show     show its image in the terminal
  godmode picard play     loop the original audio excerpt
  godmode picard stop     stop the player

  Nothing plays on its own. The first request downloads the asset from
  YTMND into a local cache; neither asset is in this archive.

Credits

